Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:03.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:05.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.93,0:00:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:11.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家乡与家人全被歼灭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟琥珀又落在奈落的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:16.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不管珊瑚多么灰心失意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最贴心的小猫 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,始终陪在她的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师加上珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:24.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:32.21,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:36.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:40.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:48.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:56.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:02.55,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:06.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:10.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:14.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.23,0:01:18.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:22.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.01,0:01:26.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:33.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:38.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:45.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:02.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟随我们同行的云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:05.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一只有两条尾巴的叉尾猫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.59,0:02:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要战斗的时候 它会变得非常大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可以在空中自由飞来飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,平时它却是一只非常可爱的小猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:15.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母的脾气非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算大家对它不好 它也是逆来顺受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过必要时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:22.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好也让大家知道一下 你也是有脾气的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第97话 云母为什么没回家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.12,0:02:56.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有没有人看见云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:02:59.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.20,0:03:03.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天一早起来就没有看到它了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会出去散步了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:08.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是云母从来不会不说一声就自己跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是离家出走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会正在发情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.45,0:03:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看恐怕是叛逆期
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让珊瑚更加担心了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过昨天云母看起来真的没有什么异常
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.62,0:03:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过溜出去逛逛 不需要大惊小怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.23,0:03:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:32.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果连这种事也要瞎操心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:34.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们岂不是要忙得不可开交了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.47,0:03:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就别管它了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等它玩够了自然会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.27,0:03:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别太担心了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:43.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母又不是小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:44.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过咧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换了是别的小孩子 就又另当别论了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:48.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说也是有道理啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这什么意思 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪有什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就只有你一个小孩子而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烤鱼已经可以吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:02.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.97,0:04:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁说云母马上就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在连个影子都没看到嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.25,0:04:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪知道它什么时候回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说这什么话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明自己说过的话 这么快就忘光啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到外面去找云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:44.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样漫无目的到处找
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕也毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:51.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是由犬夜叉上场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个 是要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:57.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是云母吃饭的盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:04:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开猫罐头喂它的时候用的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:02.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿这个给我要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你最好闻清楚盘子里的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母身上的味道我会不知道吗？ 哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.79,0:05:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好加油 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？闻出来了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:24.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 味道在途中消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只爬了三步就不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是大家分头找好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过没用啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母的味道突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就表示它飞上空中了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这附近根本就没有它的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不能够什么事都不做对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:46.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点我当然懂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:47.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有什么线索可以参考
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:53.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比方说你跟云母吵过架啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是云母是不是附近有认识的朋友啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细想想总会有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样问我我也不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么细节都可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.55,0:06:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比方说吃东西没有胃口啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:06.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近脾气特别古怪啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是附近出现了一些野猫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…或许是因为我害的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有理会云母的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都让云母卷入我跟妖怪的决斗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:22.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要到远方去 我就理所当然的骑着它上路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.37,0:06:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有奖励赞美过它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连它最喜欢吃的鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有常常给它吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 别太责怪自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母不会为了这些事离家出走的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:35.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想到云母为什么离家出走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为刚刚犬夜叉欺负我才让我想起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要随便想想就可以知道原因何在了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底为什么？你快说 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:52.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母它…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母是因为犬夜叉还有你们害的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会离家出走的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.41,0:07:03.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再废话了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:05.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么话快说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是这个样子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:11.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.55,0:07:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们大家手捂着胸口 好好反省一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.55,0:07:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是真的从来没有做过对不起云母的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们当中有谁谁敢这样断言
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以发誓我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:29.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想不起来曾经做过什么事…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们对云母做过哪些过分的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就让我一件件说给你们听吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:40.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一次犬夜叉为了学会爆破流技术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让云母陪他一起练风之伤对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:51.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,练风之伤那一次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 要不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:37.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秃掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…这个自然自己就会好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:48.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧不要紧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:52.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来来 吃饭吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:55.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有这回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起来了 那阵子的确有这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:03.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你以为可以这样神不知鬼不觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就错了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.16,0:09:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母离家出走一定是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！都是你害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦咦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:14.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来云母的秃头是你造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:19.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 云母…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:21.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不能这样就断定云母离家出走跟我有关
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况这件事情已经发生那么久了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母一定早就忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:32.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道还会有其他原因吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样说不定真的有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.19,0:09:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你可别说你也忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:40.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.07,0:09:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 村子里有好多年轻小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:55.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子云母可以派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.22,0:09:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:04.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪来的小猫 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫叫作云母
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我养的宠物猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:13.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几位姑娘也是一样可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 法师你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.87,0:10:21.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不只这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:27.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 你就是上次那位法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.11,0:10:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天晚上你一定要留在村子里过夜哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请到我家里来吧 到我家怎样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 又该云母上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.86,0:10:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶灵 退散
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:50.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太…太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不是啦 这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:10:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 真是伤脑筋耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母它是我们的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然当它是道具一样使用方便
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:06.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后不可以再有这样的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.29,0:11:10.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就从没当云母是道具一样使用方便吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:13.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？咦咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:29.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:31.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 到底什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:32.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:34.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道又要什么“考试”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.05,0:11:37.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这个啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好舒服啊 拜托你了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:49.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你肯帮我完成心愿的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.19,0:11:52.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就请你吃比目鱼跟鲔鱼口味的猫罐头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.43,0:11:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:04.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底回家干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:14.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你在这边等我一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:16.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快就会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 你一定要等我喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:29.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这样 大家先来切蛋糕好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那就先来切蛋糕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.37,0:12:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 祝你生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.97,0:12:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然赶回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么犬夜叉哥哥没跟你一起回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 爷爷 这是送给你的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜喔 这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是很清楚它的来源啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.02,0:12:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这个跟河童的手不一样 如假包换的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天能不能多留一下下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:56.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:58.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得爷爷过生日
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.03,0:13:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少大家一起吃个饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得爷爷过生日嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 答应云母带罐头回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.78,0:13:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也忘得一干二净了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连戈薇也这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:26.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这几个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后不准你们再虐待可爱的小妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:34.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后如果你再敢用拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:36.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打我任何一拳的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:39.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就罚你整整一个礼拜都不准吃忍者餐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去 别自己订罚则
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.17,0:13:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你千万不要误会 我们只不过是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.41,0:13:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很对不起 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:54.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我并没有恶意的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:59.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实 我又有什么立场指责你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别这么说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你们没什么不同
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:03.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上睡不着的时候 心烦意乱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都会叫云母带我飞过午夜的山岭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:11.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些真的没什么大不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才过分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炉火升不起来的时候 我就叫云母变身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的时候 一天里面好几次让它去冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它明明睡着了 我却捏它的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:22.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了好玩 还要它陪我玩变装游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:25.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿…戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:30.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个几乎一点都不疼它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们简直坏透了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是个愚蠢的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的以为能够平安穿过我的势力范围吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:08.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:09.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:12.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这座森林实在太缺食物了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:18.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为是云母呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:21.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然是一只狒狒妖怪再加上个大叔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大叔 快点走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又…又是个妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.57,0:15:42.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好大的胆子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢放走我的猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.71,0:15:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:51.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:52.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:56.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我确实闻到了云母的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:15:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一个一个来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.95,0:16:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我送给云母的丝巾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:09.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:10.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.93,0:16:13.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森林里到处都是动物的骸骨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪！你把云母给吃了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:28.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃的动物这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪还记得吃过谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说真的是你吃的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用太难过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们很快就可以见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:41.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上进我的肚子来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整座森林都是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森林里的一切全都归我管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用树枝的反作用力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后灵活进行快速移动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从绝对有利的制高点进行攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚妖怪说的话 也不全是吓唬我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候要是云母在就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫云母？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后要靠你照顾它了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:03.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:11.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是只慌张得到处乱窜的杂碎妖怪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种家伙我一下就…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不放过你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.51,0:18:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要替云母报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭这种打断树枝的本事也想要跟我斗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:08.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能更重视一点云母的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母已经… 呜呜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:21.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…！ 你…你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:22.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.71,0:19:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:26.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:28.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你平安无事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:37.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 害我们担心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:09.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好久不见了 犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:12.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刀刀斋吩咐我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:18.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带一块磨刀石来给犬夜叉少爷磨铁碎牙的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,磨刀石？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么把这么重的东西搬来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 不是很简单吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拜托云母帮我搬来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是专程到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.91,0:20:32.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑在云母身上回到刀刀斋那
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着马上再赶回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.61,0:20:36.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一把老骨头差点没散掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然来找你 想请你帮个忙行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么 半夜三更叫什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:49.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 我要云母帮我点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得帮我跟犬夜叉他们说一声
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:56.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要一天的功夫就能赶回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那条丝巾是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那条丝巾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有时间在这儿逗留玩耍哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:25.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整件事就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.65,0:21:31.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概…也许…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:41.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我睡得太熟所以忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.20,0:21:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么你睡得太熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好给我觉悟了 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.43,0:21:50.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.20,0:21:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见好就收吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.61,0:21:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:21:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑 七宝 不要嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:14.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.68,0:22:24.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.95,0:22:34.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:43.93,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:48.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:53.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:23:01.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.22,0:23:07.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.93,0:23:12.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:19.37,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.91,0:23:28.97,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.88,0:23:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.25,0:23:53.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哪里不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.59,0:23:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快一起离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.29,0:23:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.32,0:23:58.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经失去了死魂 你别理我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.06,0:23:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果只有你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.33,0:24:01.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定还有机会活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么容易放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.60,0:24:04.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果想要离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.83,0:24:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要同心协力才行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.83,0:24:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.27,0:24:11.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山洞里只有桔梗跟戈薇两人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.57,0:24:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一股充满血气的温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.01,0:24:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这就是戈薇的坚强吗
